If I only have the Jakarta property, step 3 returns null. Then `getAdditionalProperties` removes `hibernate.hbm2ddl.auto` from vendor properties. But `jakarta.persistence.schema-generation.database.action: update` is still in the vendor properties.

Let me just test one clean path: set BOTH `hibernate.hbm2ddl.auto: update` and the Jakarta property in the properties map.

